This repository formalizes an abstract algebraic metriplectic structure
in Lean 4. It is not a solution of the Clay Millennium Navier–Stokes
problem. A successful Lean kernel check is not a PDE proof or a physical
proof. Classical results of Arnold, Morrison and collaborators are cited,
not claimed as new.
